     facts: [["Spoofed source", "198.51.100.53"], ["Guessing", "16-bit transaction ID (+ port)"], ["Payload", "portal → 203.0.113.200"]],
     defender: "Resolvers log replies with the wrong transaction ID. A sudden flood of them is a poisoning attempt.",
